absolute;\n      left: 183px;\n      top: 24px;\n      font-size: 13px;\n      transform: rotate(-2deg);\n    }\n\n    .q3-notes .red-side-2 {\n      position: absolute;\n      left: 203px;\n      top: 61px;\n      width: 111px;\n      font-size: 12px;\n      line-height: 16px;\n      transform: rotate(-3deg);\n    }\n\n    .q3-notes .imag-box {\n      display: inline-block;\n      padding: 0 2px;\n      border: 1.5px solid #e11a22;\n      line-height: 18px;\n      transform: rotate(2deg);\n    }\n\n    .tiny-red-label {\n      position: absolute;\n      left: 255px;\n      top: 649px;\n      color: #df111b;\n      font-family: \"KaiTi\", \"STKaiti\", cursive;\n      font-size: 11px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      transform: rotate(-7deg);\n    }\n\n    sup, sub {\n      font-size: 75%;\n      line-height: 0;\n    }\n\n    i.math {\n      font-family: \"Times New Roman\", serif;\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"page\">\n    <section class=\"question q1 printed\">\n      <div class=\"question-text\">\n        A，B分别是复数<i class=\"math\">z</i><sub>1</sub>，<i class=\"math\">z</i><sub>2</sub>在复平面内对应的点，O是原点，若\n        |<i class=\"math\">z</i><sub>1</sub> + <i class=\"math\">z</i><sub>2</sub>| =\n        |<i class=\"math\">z</i><sub>1</sub> − <i class=\"math\">z</i><sub>2</sub>|，则三角形AOB—\n      </div>\n      <div>定是<span class=\"answer-mark\">B</span>.</div>\n      <div class=\"options\">\n        <span>A.&nbsp; 等腰三角形</span>\n        <span>B.&nbsp; 直角三角形</span>\n        <span>C.&nbsp; 等边三角形</span>\n        <span>D.&nbsp; 等腰直角三角形</span>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <div class=\"margin-scribble\">∵</div>\n\n    <aside class=\"hand q1-notes\">\n      <div class=\"line heading\">由复数的几何意义得</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">∵ <span class=\"vector\">OA</span>，<span class=\"vector\">OB</span> 表示 <i>z</i><sub>1</sub>，<i>z</i><sub>2</sub></div>\n      <div class=\"line\">∵ |<i>z</i><sub>1</sub>+<i>z</i><sub>2</sub>| = |<i>z</i><sub>1</sub>−<i>z</i><sub>2</sub>|</div>\n      <div class=\"line compact\">∴ 由平面向量的加法法则</div>\n      <div class=\"line compact long\">以OA、OB为邻边作平行四边形，则两条对角线模相等</div>\n      <div class=\"line compact\">∴ 此平行四边形为长方形</div>\n      <div class=\"line compact\">∴ △AOB为直角三角形</div>\n    </aside>\n\n    <figure class=\"placeholder diagram\">\n      <svg width=\"104\" height=\"56\" viewBox=\"0 0 104 56\" aria-label=\"手绘平行四边形向量图\">\n        <defs>\n          <marker id=\"arrow-red\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" refX=\"5\" refY=\"3\" orient=\"auto\">\n            <path d=\"M0,0 L6,3 L0,6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#e31b23\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/>\n          </marker>\n        </defs>\n        <path d=\"M8 12 L96 8\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#e31b23\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow-red)\"/>\n        <path d=\"M8 12 L36 46\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#e31b23\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow-red)\"/>\n        <path d=\"M36 46 L96 8\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#168cb5\" stroke-width=\"1.1\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 2\"/>\n        <path d=\"M8 12 L62 39 L96 8\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#168cb5\" stroke-width=\"1.1\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 2\"/>\n        <circle cx=\"8\" cy=\"12\" r=\"2.3\" fill=\"#e31b23\"/>\n        <text x=\"0\" y=\"10\" fill=\"#e31b23\" font-size=\"10\" font-family=\"KaiTi\">O</text>\n        <text x=\"34\" y=\"55\" fill=\"#168cb5\" font-size=\"9\" font-family=\"KaiTi\">A</text>\n        <text x=\"95\" y=\"18\" fill=\"#168cb5\" font-size=\"9\" font-family=\"KaiTi\">B</text>\n        <text x=\"20\" y=\"31\" fill=\"#168cb5\" font-size=\"8\" font-family=\"KaiTi\">θ</text>\n        <text x=\"70\" y=\"28\" fill=\"#168cb5\" font-size=\"8\" font-family=\"KaiTi\">90°</text>\n      </svg>\n      <figcaption>[Diagram: upper-right]</figcaption>\n    </figure>\n\n    <section class=\"question q2 printed\">\n      <div class=\"question-text\">\n        已知<i class=\"math\">i</i>为虚数单位，则<i class=\"math\">i</i> +\n        <i class=\"math\">i</i><sup>2</sup> +\n        <i class=\"math\">i</i><sup>3</sup> + ⋯ +\n        <i class=\"math\">i</i><sup>2019</sup>等于（<span class=\"answer-mark\">D</span>）.\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"options\">\n        <span>A.&nbsp; <i>i</i></span>\n        <span>B.&nbsp; 1</span>\n        <span>C.&nbsp; −<i>i</i></span>\n        <span>D.&nbsp; −1</span>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <aside class=\"hand q2-notes\">\n      <div class=\"line\"><i>i</i> + <i>i</i><sup>2</sup> + <i>i</i><sup>3</sup> + ⋯ + <i>i</i><sup>2019</sup></div>\n      <div class=\"line\">= <i>i</i> + <i>i</i><sup>2</sup> + <i>i</i><sup>3</sup> + ⋯ + <i>i</i><sup>2019</sup></div>\n      <div class=\"red-box\">\n        <i>i</i><sup>2017</sup>+<i>i</i><sup>2018</sup>+<i>i</i><sup>2019</sup>+<i>i</i><sup>2020</sup> = 0\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"red cycle-note\">周期为4，因此四项和为0</div>\n      <div class=\"line final\">∴ 原式 = <i>i</i> + <i>i</i><sup>2</sup> + <i>i</i><sup>3</sup></div>\n      <div class=\"line final\">　　= −1</div>\n    </aside>\n\n    <section class=\"question q3 printed\">\n      <div class=\"question-text\">\n        若复数<i class=\"math\">z</i>满足(3 − 4<i class=\"math\">i</i>)<i class=\"math\">z</i> =\n        |4 + 3<i class=\"math\">i</i>|，则<i class=\"math\">z</i>的虚部为（<span class=\"answer-mark\">B</span>）.\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"options\">\n        <span>A.&nbsp; −4</span>\n        <span>B.&nbsp; <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"den\">5</span></span></span>\n        <span>C.&nbsp; −4<i>i</i></span>\n        <span>D.&nbsp; −<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"den\">5</span></span><i>i</i></span>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <aside class=\"hand q3-notes\">\n      <div class=\"equation\">∵ (3−4<i>i</i>)<i>z</i> = |4+3<i>i</i>|</div>\n      <div class=\"equation\">∴ <i>z</i> =\n        <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"num\">|4+3<i>i</i>|</span><span class=\"den\">3−4<i>i</i></span></span>\n        =\n        <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"num\">5</span><span class=\"den\">3−4<i>i</i></span></span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"equation indent\">=\n        <span class=\"frac\">\n          <span class=\"num\">5(3+4<i>i</i>)</span>\n          <span class=\"den\">(3−4<i>i</i>)(3+4<i>i</i>)</span>\n        </span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"equation indent\">=\n        <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"den\">5</span></span>\n        +\n        <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"den\">5</span></span><i>i</i>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"equation\">∴ <i>z</i> =\n        <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"den\">5</span></span>\n        +\n        <span class=\"imag-box\"><span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"den\">5</span></span><i>i</i></span>，∴ <i>z</i>的虚部为\n        <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"den\">5</span></span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"red red-side-1\">→先求出<i>z</i></div>\n      <div class=\"red red-side-2\">→利用分母的3−4<i>i</i><br>的共轭复数</div>\n    </aside>\n\n    <div class=\"tiny-red-label\">虚部</div>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>"
